WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.150
Standing medium punch starts the close-range confirm.

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.700
Crouching medium punch connects before the Super cancel.

3
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:05.100
Chun-Li activates Hoyokusen and spends two Super stocks.

4
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.000
The final Super strike launches Jamie.

5
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.750
A delayed jumping medium punch catches Jamie as he falls.

6
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:07.700
Serenity Stream medium kick continues after landing.

7
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.600
Heavy Tensho Kicks completes the juggle.

8
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.100
Jamie falls at the end of the route.
